units('b216',r'''
名目停留時間與水齡~Nominal residence and water age||供水水庫的體積除以平均取水率得到名目周轉時間，適合比較儲水量與需求尺度。翡翠背景下的真實水齡還取決於密度分層、入流短路及死水區，所以這個商不能代表每滴水都在庫內停留相同天數。~Stored volume divided by mean withdrawal gives a nominal turnover scale useful for comparing storage and demand. Actual water age also depends on stratification, short-circuit inflows and stagnant zones, so the quotient does not describe the travel time of every parcel.||V=20000000 m3; Q=4 m3/s; tau=V/Q/86400=57.87037 day||穩態體積與平均流量的尺度估算，沒有假設真實水庫完全混合~A steady-volume and mean-flow scale estimate, without asserting complete mixing in the actual reservoir||核對體積是有效交換區還是總庫容，將流量平均時段寫清楚。用水溫或保守示蹤物的深度剖面辨識隔離水層，再比較不同取水高程的到達時間，檢查名目周轉是否掩蓋短路。~Check whether volume represents active exchange or total storage and state the averaging period for discharge. Use temperature or conservative-tracer depth profiles to identify isolated layers, then compare arrival times at withdrawal elevations to assess possible short circuiting.||以整座水庫體積計算後宣稱污染會在該天數全部消失，忽略長尾水齡與沉積再釋出；短路可能讓部分新入流水更早抵達取水口，兩種偏差可同時存在。~Claiming that contamination disappears after one nominal residence time ignores long age tails and sediment release. Short circuiting can simultaneously deliver some newly arrived water much earlier to the intake.||平均周轉天數不是每滴水的實際水齡~Mean turnover time is not the age of every water parcel||將有效交換體積減為原值七成，計算名目停留時間，再畫完全混合與短路兩種概念流路，說明單一平均數無法分辨何者。~Reduce the actively exchanging volume to seventy percent, recalculate turnover and sketch complete mixing and short-circuit pathways. Explain why the same nominal mean cannot distinguish their very different age distributions.||20000000/4/86400||57.87037||day||0.00001
曲面水平投影的水推力~Hydrostatic horizontal projected force||曲面上的水壓始終沿表面法線，水平分力可用垂直投影面積積分取得。翡翠拱壩背景的示範只計一塊假想投影條帶，不把合力直接當作壩基剪力，也不忽略曲面另外可能承受的垂直分量。~Pressure acts normally to a curved surface, while its horizontal component follows integration over the vertical projection. This exercise treats a hypothetical projected strip rather than equating the result to foundation shear or discarding other force components on the curved body.||rho=1000 kg/m3; g=9.81 m/s2; b=10 m; H=40 m; F=rho g b H2/2/1e6=78.48 MN||頂端位於自由液面的垂直矩形投影，靜水且尾水壓未計~A vertical rectangular projection starting at the free surface, with hydrostatic water and no downstream pressure||畫出隨深度線性增加的壓力三角形，用底壓乘面積再除二重算合力。核對作用點在水深下方三分之二位置，並列出曲面法線方向與水平投影之間的轉換，避免面積重複計入。~Draw the triangular pressure distribution and independently recover force from half the base pressure times projected area. Check that the resultant acts two thirds of the depth below the surface, then distinguish actual curved area from its horizontal-force projection.||把平均水壓誤設為底部最大水壓會使合力加倍；又若把投影條帶的合力直接均分給所有拱圈，便忽略深度變化與三維承載分配，產生錯誤應力圖。~Using bottom pressure as average pressure doubles the resultant. Distributing the projected-strip force equally among every arch ring then ignores depth variation and three-dimensional load sharing, producing a misleading stress picture.||曲面實際面積不能直接取代水平力投影面積~Actual curved area cannot replace the projection for horizontal force||把水深從四十公尺增至四十八公尺，計算合力倍率並比較壓力倍率，解釋為何總推力增加快於底壓，以及投影寬度假設有何影響。~Increase depth from forty to forty-eight metres, compare force and bottom-pressure multipliers, and explain why resultant force grows faster. State how the assumed projected width limits the interpretation of the comparison.||1000*9.81*10*40**2/2/1e6||78.48||MN||0.00001
拱與懸臂剛度分力~Arch and cantilever load sharing||雙曲率壩的水平拱作用與垂直懸臂作用共同抵抗水壓。用同位移的兩個並聯彈簧表示這兩條力路，可看出較硬路徑分擔更多荷載，但這只是相容變形概念，不能把兩彈簧視為互不影響的真實壩塊。~Horizontal arch and vertical cantilever action jointly resist pressure. Parallel springs with a common displacement illustrate why the stiffer load path attracts more force, while remaining an analogy rather than two independent physical blocks of a real double-curvature dam.||ka=3000 MN/m; kc=2000 MN/m; F=50 MN; Fa=F ka/(ka+kc)=30 MN||線性並聯與共同位移，只示範力路分配，不提供局部應力~Linear parallel paths with shared displacement illustrate force distribution without predicting local stresses||分別用總剛度求位移，再以兩個剛度乘位移重建分力，確認分力相加等於外力。改變其中一條路徑剛度時，同時記錄另一條分力如何增加，並說明真實壩體需要何種接縫及基礎資料。~Find displacement from total stiffness, recover each force from stiffness times displacement and verify equilibrium. Change one path stiffness while tracking the other force, then identify joint and foundation information required to move beyond this simple compatibility analogy.||認為一條力路變軟只會減少整體受力，漏掉荷載向另一力路轉移；若仍保留原分力卻改用新剛度，則位移不相容，模型已失去共同變形的基本前提。~Softening one path does not simply remove load; it redirects force into the other path. Keeping old force shares with new stiffnesses creates incompatible displacements and violates the model's central assumption.||較柔的路徑卸載會使另一條路徑增加負擔~A softer path unloads while the other path carries more||把拱剛度降至二千四百兆牛頓每公尺，重新求兩條分力及共同位移，畫出荷載轉移方向，指出這項結果仍不能判定局部裂縫是否擴展。~Reduce arch stiffness to twenty-four hundred meganewtons per metre, recalculate both forces and displacement, and draw redistribution. Explain why these results alone cannot determine whether a local crack will propagate.||50*3000/(3000+2000)||30||MN||0.00001
岩盤層面有效正向力~Effective force on rock bedding||拱推力進入有層面的岩盤時，抗滑摩擦取決於扣除孔隙水壓後的有效正向力。假想單一平面模型把水壓作用面積明列出來，讓學員看見排水如何改變有效力，而不是把總壓力全部當成可用摩擦來源。~Thrust entering bedded rock mobilizes friction according to normal force remaining after water pressure is deducted. A single-plane model explicitly includes pressurized area, showing how drainage changes effective force rather than treating total compression as entirely available for friction.||N=80 MN; u=0.3 MPa; A=100 m2; phi=30 deg; R=(N-uA)tan(phi)=28.86751 MN||不計黏聚與側向約束，孔壓均勻；只算摩擦抗力不是安全係數~No cohesion or lateral confinement, with uniform pore pressure; the result is frictional resistance, not a safety factor||先核對兆帕乘平方公尺等於兆牛頓，再以測壓管代表範圍估算壓力分布。比較排水前後孔壓與位移趨勢，注意單一測點不能代表整條層面，並另列未知的剪力需求與力矩。~Verify that megapascals times square metres produce meganewtons, then examine how piezometers represent the pressure field. Compare pressure and movement before and after drainage, noting that one point cannot characterize the entire plane and that shear demand remains unspecified.||把總正向力直接乘摩擦係數會高估抗力；若測壓點位在局部低壓排水孔旁，可能漏掉遠處高壓區，使看似合理的平均孔壓掩蓋層面有效力不足。~Multiplying total normal force by friction coefficient overestimates resistance. A sensor beside a local drain may miss a remote high-pressure zone, so an apparently reasonable average can conceal reduced effective contact force.||摩擦抗力的數值本身不是滑動安全係數~A friction-resistance value is not a sliding safety factor||把均勻孔壓提高到零點四兆帕，重算摩擦抗力並畫孔壓與抗力關係，再討論何時有效正向力趨近零會使簡化接觸假設失效。~Raise uniform pore pressure to zero point four megapascals, recalculate resistance and plot its pressure dependence. Discuss why the contact assumption breaks down as effective normal force approaches zero.||(80-0.3*100)*math.tan(math.radians(30))||28.86751||MN||0.00001
溫度變形與接縫開度~Thermal movement and joint gap||拱壩接縫的相對開合會受到塊體溫度、拘束及水壓共同影響。自由熱伸縮長度可以當作幾何尺度，但不能直接等同實際縫寬；縫面接觸後可能傳力，張開後傳力條件又會改變，形成非線性問題。~Relative joint movement responds to block temperature, restraint and hydraulic loading. Free thermal movement provides a geometric scale rather than the actual gap, because contact can transmit force while opening changes the load path and introduces nonlinearity.||alpha=0.00001 1/K; L=24 m; dT=15 K; dL=alpha L dT*1000=3.6 mm||單一塊體自由伸長，未加入兩側塊體、拘束及初始縫寬~Free expansion of one block, excluding adjacent blocks, restraint and initial gap||將縫計與附近溫度計同步繪圖，核對量測方向與正負號，再分別辨識日週期與季節週期。以兩側塊體的相對運動重建縫寬，不能把單側絕對位移直接當成開度。~Plot joint and temperature measurements synchronously, checking sensor direction and sign before distinguishing daily from seasonal cycles. Reconstruct gap from the relative motion of both sides rather than treating one block's absolute displacement as joint opening.||把自由伸長全數加到縫寬而不考慮方向，可能把閉合預測成張開；若縫面已接觸仍用同一直線關係外推，就會忽略接觸壓力與剛度突然改變。~Adding all free expansion to gap without checking direction can predict opening where closure occurs. Continuing the same linear relation after contact ignores the resulting contact pressure and abrupt change in stiffness.||自由伸長的量級不等於實測接縫開度~Free-expansion magnitude is not the measured joint aperture||畫兩側等長塊體同時升溫的幾何圖，指定固定端位置後求相對位移，再與單側伸長比較，說明接縫初始間隙對是否接觸的影響。~Sketch two equal blocks warming together, specify their fixed ends and derive relative movement. Compare it with single-block expansion and explain how the initial gap determines whether contact develops.||0.00001*24*15*1000||3.6||mm||0.00001
密度分層與取水慣性~Stratification and withdrawal inertia||水庫冷暖水層的密度差提供恢復浮力，取水流速則會拉動界面。以約化重力及密度福祿數比較慣性與浮力，可討論選擇性取水是否容易擾動水層，但實際取水形狀、界面厚度與三維流場仍不可省略。~Density contrast between warm and cool layers supplies restoring buoyancy while withdrawal velocity disturbs the interface. Reduced gravity and a densimetric Froude number compare inertia with buoyancy, without resolving intake geometry, interface thickness or the three-dimensional withdrawal field.||g=9.81 m/s2; drho=2 kg/m3; rho=1000 kg/m3; h=8 m; v=0.2 m/s; Fr=v/sqrt(g drho h/rho)=0.50482||兩層近似、密度差小且水深為假想作用尺度，非設備臨界值~A small-density-difference two-layer approximation with hypothetical depth scale, not an equipment threshold||沿深度量測溫度與密度，確認界面存在並記錄測點時間，再用流量與有效進水面積估算局部速度。比較不同取水時段的剖面變化，留意風混合也可能造成界面移動而非全部由取水引起。~Measure depth profiles of temperature and density to establish an interface and record sampling times. Estimate local velocity from flow and effective intake area, then compare profiles across withdrawal periods while accounting for wind-driven mixing as an alternative cause.||把全庫平均流速代替取水口附近速度可能嚴重低估慣性；直接把無因次數當成固定允許值，也會忽略幾何、分層厚度與入流條件，使比較失去物理依據。~Reservoir-wide mean velocity can greatly understate inertia near an intake. Treating the dimensionless number as a universal permitted value ignores geometry, interface thickness and inflow conditions that control its interpretation.||密度福祿數是比較尺度而非通用操作門檻~Densimetric Froude number is a comparison scale, not a universal operating limit||將密度差減半而保持速度不變，重算無因次數並描述浮力恢復變弱的意義，再列出需用水槽或數值模型確認的取水口幾何效應。~Halve the density difference at unchanged velocity, recalculate the dimensionless number and explain weaker buoyant restoration. Identify intake-geometry effects requiring physical experiments or a resolved flow model.||0.2/math.sqrt(9.81*2*8/1000)||0.504819||dimensionless||0.00001
颱風入流與短時水位~Storm inflow and short term level||颱風期間水量累積取決於入流減放流的時程，水面積把蓄量差轉成水位差。以局部固定面積作近似可快速估計量級，但翡翠的真實地形曲線與隨水位變動的出口能力會使線性估算偏離實況。~During a storm, storage accumulates from the time history of inflow minus release. Local water area converts volume change into level change as a first approximation, while real geometry and level-dependent outlet behavior can depart from that linear estimate.||Qnet=140 m3/s; dt=10800 s; A=8000000 m2; dH=Qnet dt/A=0.189 m||三小時淨入流與水面積固定，沒有指定實際蓄洪空間或放流規則~Constant net inflow and surface area for three hours, without specifying real flood space or release rules||用逐時入出流積分先求體積，再以相鄰高程面積曲線求水位並比較固定面積結果。保留初始水位及面積資料年代，查明降雨、側流和量測時間差是否已納入水量平衡。~Integrate hourly inlet and outlet flows for volume, then use neighboring elevation-area data to estimate level and compare with the fixed-area result. Retain initial level and survey date, checking rainfall, lateral inflow and measurement timing in the balance.||只用暴雨峰值流量乘整場歷時會放大蓄量；反之以日平均淹沒短時洪峰，可能低估最大水位。沒有初始水位的增加量無法判斷剩餘空間是否足夠。~Multiplying a storm peak by the whole event overstates volume, while daily averaging can suppress the maximum level. A level increment without the initial elevation cannot establish how much storage space remains.||水位增量不能獨立回答剩餘蓄洪空間~A level increment alone cannot establish remaining flood storage||把水面積改成隨水位增加的兩段值，分段解同一體積的水位增量，再比較固定面積近似的高估或低估方向，註明地形曲線的不確定性。~Use two surface-area segments that increase with elevation, solve the level change for the same volume and determine whether constant area overestimates or underestimates it, retaining uncertainty in the geometry curve.||140*10800/8000000||0.189||m||0.000001
水躍共軛水深~Hydraulic jump conjugate depths||溢流後的高速淺水若轉成低速深水，可透過水躍耗散能量。矩形渠道的動量平衡給出上下游共軛水深，這不代表任意尾水都能穩住水躍；實際消能池還受床面、空氣摻混及側向流動影響。~A hydraulic jump converts fast shallow flow into slower deeper flow while dissipating energy. Rectangular-channel momentum gives conjugate depths, but arbitrary tailwater will not necessarily hold the jump in place, and actual basins involve aeration, bed details and lateral effects.||y1=1 m; v1=8 m/s; g=9.81 m/s2; Fr1=v1/sqrt(g y1); y2=y1(sqrt(1+8Fr1^2)-1)/2=3.14663 m||水平矩形渠道、靜水壓斷面與一維動量；未提供真實消能池尺寸~Horizontal rectangular channel, hydrostatic sections and one-dimensional momentum, without sizing an actual basin||先用連續方程求下游平均速度，再核對兩斷面的動量函數接近相等，最後比較比能以確認能量下降。水槽觀察應記錄水躍位置與尾水變化，不能只量一張照片中的水深。~Use continuity to recover downstream velocity, check equality of momentum functions and compare specific energy to confirm dissipation. In a flume, record jump location as tailwater changes rather than relying on depths captured in a single photograph.||把共軛水深當成保證穩定水躍的尾水設定，可能忽略掃出或淹沒；若又把耗能量當作局部壓力，將無法辨識床面脈動、氣蝕與沖刷的不同機制。~A conjugate depth does not guarantee a stable jump; sweep-out or submergence may occur. Treating dissipated energy as local pressure also obscures distinct mechanisms of fluctuating loads, cavitation and scour.||動量守恆的水躍會耗能而非能量守恆~A momentum-conserving hydraulic jump dissipates mechanical energy||將入口速度改為六公尺每秒，重新求共軛水深和出口速度，說明為何水躍高度改變，並列出需要尾水曲線才能判斷的定位問題。~Reduce inlet velocity to six metres per second, recalculate conjugate depth and downstream velocity, and explain the height change. Identify jump-location questions that require a tailwater relationship.||(math.sqrt(1+8*8**2/9.81)-1)/2||3.146630||m||0.00001
含砂濃度與固體負荷~Sediment concentration and mass load||流量與懸浮固體質量濃度相乘得到輸入固體的質量率，可把集水區侵蝕與水庫占容問題串連。濁度是光學反應而非質量濃度，翡翠背景的教學不能不經現地校準就把濁度單位直接乘流量。~Discharge times suspended-solids mass concentration gives a solids delivery rate linking catchment erosion to reservoir storage. Turbidity is an optical response rather than mass concentration, so it cannot be multiplied directly by flow without a site-specific conversion and its uncertainty.||Q=12 m3/s; C=0.35 kg/m3; dt=7200 s; M=Q C dt=30240 kg||兩小時代表濃度與流量固定，僅懸浮輸砂，不含推移質與庫內沉降~Constant representative concentration and flow for two hours; suspended load only, excluding bed load and reservoir deposition||同時採集斷面流量與混合代表水樣，以過濾乾燥法取得質量濃度，再用濁度建立有誤差範圍的輔助關係。檢查洪峰前後是否有遲滯，避免只採清水期而漏掉主要固體負荷。~Pair cross-section discharge with representative composite samples, determine mass concentration by filtration and drying, and use turbidity only through an uncertain calibration. Check rising and falling limbs for hysteresis so clear-water sampling does not miss the dominant solids load.||以單一岸邊樣本代表全斷面會漏掉垂向與橫向濃度梯度；把輸入固體全當作永久沉積，也會忽略排出、再懸浮與密度壓密，使庫容損失估算偏離。~One bank sample may miss vertical and lateral gradients. Treating all incoming solids as permanent deposition ignores passage, resuspension and compaction, so transported mass cannot directly establish lost reservoir volume.||濁度與每立方公尺固體公斤數不是同一量~Turbidity and kilograms of solids per cubic metre are different quantities||假設濃度在第一小時加倍而第二小時減半，分段求質量並比較原值，再說明若流量同步變動，使用兩個平均值相乘會有何偏差。~Double concentration in the first hour and halve it in the second, integrate mass and compare with the original case. Explain the bias from multiplying separate averages when discharge varies simultaneously.||12*0.35*7200||30240||kg||0.001
原水保守溶質混合~Conservative raw water mixing||不同深度原水混合後，保守溶質濃度由流量加權質量守恆求得。這個概念能教導取水來源比例的重要性，但濁度、藻類與會反應的物質不一定線性混合，不能把保守示蹤物公式套到所有水質指標。~A conservative dissolved constituent mixes according to flow-weighted mass balance, illustrating the importance of source proportions. Turbidity, algae and reactive substances need not mix linearly, so the tracer equation is not a universal relationship for every water-quality indicator.||Q1=3 m3/s; C1=20 mg/L; Q2=2 m3/s; C2=50 mg/L; Cm=(Q1C1+Q2C2)/(Q1+Q2)=32 mg/L||充分混合、無反應的假想溶質，不表示濁度或飲用水合格限值~Complete mixing of a hypothetical nonreactive solute, not turbidity or a drinking-water acceptance limit||以相同時段的兩股來源流量及濃度求輸入質量率，核對混合後取樣位置已有足夠混合距離。將預測值與出口樣本比較時，先補上停留時間，避免把不同水團的濃度直接相減。~Use simultaneous source flows and concentrations to calculate input mass rate and confirm that the outlet sample follows sufficient mixing distance. Account for travel time before comparing predicted and measured concentrations so different water parcels are not subtracted as if simultaneous.||拿濁度直接做保守濃度混合可能因顆粒絮凝而失準；若取樣位置尚未混勻，單點量值會偏向某股來源，即使整體質量守恆正確仍看似不符合公式。~Applying conservative mixing to turbidity can fail because particles flocculate. Before complete mixing, a single sample may favor one source, appearing to violate the equation even when the overall mass balance is correct.||流量加權混合不等於兩個濃度的算術平均~Flow-weighted mixing is not the arithmetic mean of concentrations||維持總流量五立方公尺每秒，把較高濃度來源減至一立方公尺每秒，重算混合濃度並畫比例曲線，註明這只是保守溶質的教材。~Keep total flow at five cubic metres per second, reduce the higher-concentration source to one and recalculate the blend. Plot concentration against source fraction and label the conservative-solute assumption explicitly.||(3*20+2*50)/(3+2)||32||mg/L||0.00001
''')
